{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:43:25+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:43:25+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Eiffage SA","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","country":"France","city":"Vélizy-Villacoublay","website":"https://www.eiffage.com","employees":87000,"summary":"Eiffage SA, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the construction and concessions businesses in France, Germany, Europe, and internationally. It operates through five segments: Construction, Infrastructure, Energy Systems, Concessions, and Holding. The company constructs and renovates housing, offices, retail, hospitality, and public facilities; develops properties; and offers urban planning and regeneration. It also engages in the construction and maintenance of roads, motorways, ports, and airports, as well as industrial and commercial projects; civil engineering of transport infrastructure, water and waste treatment plants, energy production and transmission equipment, and hydraulic structures; and turnkey metal construction. In addition, the company designs, builds, implements, integrates, operates, and maintains systems and equipment related to electrical, industrial, climate control, and energy engineering. Further, it is involved in the construction and management of works under concession contracts and public-private partnerships; development and production of hydroelectric and photovoltaic energy; and management of equity investments and services. The company was founded in 1844 and is headquartered in Vélizy-Villacoublay, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Eiffage SA, avec ses filiales, exerce des activités de construction et de concessions en France, en Allemagne, en Europe et à l’international. Elle opère à travers cinq segments : Construction, Infrastructure, Systèmes énergétiques, Concessions et Holding. L'entreprise construit et rénove des logements, des bureaux, des commerces de détail, des établissements d'accueil et des installations publiques, développe des propriétés et offre des services d'urbanisme et de régénération."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":9643200512,"shares_outstanding":98000000,"trailing_pe":8.986301,"forward_pe":7.9668503,"price_to_book":1.2543341,"ev_to_ebitda":5.611,"ev_to_revenue":0.828,"dividend_yield":0.048899997,"payout_ratio":0.436,"beta_yahoo":0.729},"targets":{"current_price":98.4,"mean":155.11765,"median":152.0,"high":197.0,"low":127.0,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":1.88235,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":6547000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-20","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.20972,"institutions_pct":0.46372002,"institutions_float_pct":0.58678,"institutions_n":438,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0015,"shares":148216,"value":14584454,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.158},{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0001,"shares":9600,"value":944640,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Atlas Capital Advisors Inc","pct":0.0,"shares":1846,"value":181646,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0108,"shares":1054217,"value":103734954,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0476},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0070999996,"shares":694181,"value":68307411,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0535},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0050999997,"shares":500467,"value":49245953,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0053},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Intl Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.0041,"shares":402573,"value":39613183,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"LAZARD FUNDS INC-Lazard Global Listed Infrastructure Portfolio","pct":0.0039,"shares":382629,"